  "priorExpiration": "2022-05-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1102.05 Revocation of Authorization.\n\n(a) The commissioner shall, after an opportunity for a hearing, revoke a person’s authority to issue citations for any of the following:\n\n(1) Failure to turn in the letter of authorization, pursuant to Saf-C 1102.03(c);\n\n(2) Materially false or misleading information in the person's application;\n\n(3) Misuse or abuse of the citation authority; or\n\n(4) Failure to abide by any provision of these rules.\n\n(b) All hearings shall be conducted by the bureau of hearings in accordance with the requirements of Saf-C 200.\n\nSource. #5951, eff 1-24-95, EXPIRED: 1-24-03\n\nNew. #7832, eff 2-22-03, EXPIRED: 10-19-11\n\nNew. #10011, eff 10-19-11; ss by #10137, eff 5-23-12, EXPIRED: 5-23-22\n\nNew. #13418, eff 7-25-22",
